# Backend API origin (OpenDEX). Include the scheme; no trailing slash.
# Point this at your own OpenDEX backend deployment.
PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://your-opendex-backend.example.com

# Connection mode:
#   unset / false  — DIRECT: the browser calls PUBLIC_API_BASE directly. Your
#                    backend must allow CORS from the app's origin.
#   true           — PROXY:  the browser calls the app same-origin, and the dev
#                    server (vite) / production worker (hooks.server.ts) forward
#                    all /v2/* requests (REST, token images, /v2/ws) to
#                    PUBLIC_API_BASE. No CORS needed.
# PUBLIC_API_PROXY=true
